---
// HowItWorks: Practical setup guide illustrating parent and child devices working together
---

<section id="cara-kerja" class="section how-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="badge-tag">Panduan Praktis</span>
      <h2>Mulai Terhubung dalam 3 Langkah Sederhana</h2>
      <p>Tidak butuh waktu lebih dari satu menit untuk menghubungkan ponsel seluruh anggota keluarga.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="flow-container">
      <!-- Step Card 1 -->
      <div class="flow-card">
        <div class="flow-tag">Tahap 1: Akun Orang Tua</div>
        <h3>Buat Grup Keluarga</h3>
        <p>Orang tua mendaftarkan akun kepala keluarga menggunakan email dan nomor telepon, lalu membuat nama grup (misalnya: "Keluarga Damar").</p>
        <div class="flow-visual-box">
          <div class="mini-screen">
            <span class="screen-title">HP Orang Tua</span>
            <div class="screen-content">
              <span class="dummy-input">Grup: Keluarga Bahagia</span>
              <span class="dummy-btn">+ Tambah Anggota</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step Card 2 -->
      <div class="flow-card">
        <div class="flow-tag">Tahap 2: Buka HP Anak</div>
        <h3>Tampilkan Kode QR</h3>
        <p>Buka aplikasi FamLoop di ponsel anak. Tanpa perlu mendaftar, langsung ketuk tombol untuk menampilkan QR code perangkat hardware.</p>
        <div class="flow-visual-box">
          <div class="mini-screen">
            <span class="screen-title">HP Anak</span>
            <div class="screen-content qr-center">
              <div class="mock-qr">
                <div class="qr-box top-left"></div>
                <div class="qr-box top-right"></div>
                <div class="qr-box bottom-left"></div>
              </div>
              <span class="qr-label">QR Siap Dipindai</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step Card 3 -->
      <div class="flow-card">
        <div class="flow-tag">Tahap 3: Pindai & Aktif</div>
        <h3>Arahkan Kamera & Selesai</h3>
        <p>Gunakan kamera di HP orang tua untuk memindai QR code anak. Perangkat otomatis terdaftar, dan lokasi anak langsung terlihat di peta.</p>
        <div class="flow-visual-box">
          <div class="mini-screen">
            <span class="screen-title">Peta Keluarga Langsung Terbuka</span>
            <div class="screen-content map-active">
              <span class="active-badge">✓ Terhubung: Kakak (Online)</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .how-section {
    background-color: var(--bg);
  }

  .section-header {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto 3.5rem auto;
  }

  .section-header h2 {
    margin: 0.75rem 0;
  }

  .flow-container {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .flow-card {
    background-color: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 2.25rem 1.75rem;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .flow-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--primary);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .flow-tag {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--primary);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .flow-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .flow-card p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .flow-visual-box {
    margin-top: auto;
    background-color: var(--surface-alt);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 1.25rem;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .mini-screen {
    background-color: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 240px;
    padding: 0.75rem;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  }

  .screen-title {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    display: block;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    padding-bottom: 0.4rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .screen-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }

  .dummy-input {
    background-color: var(--surface-alt);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    padding: 0.4rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .dummy-btn {
    background-color: var(--primary);
    color: #FFFFFF;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 0.4rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  }

  .qr-center {
    align-items: center;
  }

  .mock-qr {
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    background-color: var(--text-primary);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    position: relative;
    padding: 6px;
  }

  .qr-box {
    position: absolute;
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    background-color: var(--surface);
  }

  .qr-box.top-left { top: 6px; left: 6px; }
  .qr-box.top-right { top: 6px; right: 6px; }
  .qr-box.bottom-left { bottom: 6px; left: 6px; }

  .qr-label {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-top: 0.4rem;
  }

  .map-active {
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.5rem 0;
  }

  .active-badge {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--emerald);
    background-color: var(--emerald-subtle);
    padding: 0.35rem 0.65rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
  }
</style>
